sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as SharedUI
    participant API as IssueFromOrder
    participant Sales as GetPaidOrderSnapshot
    participant Inv as GetProductFiscalBasics
    participant Core as GetTutorDest
    participant Dom as FiscalDocument
    participant NFe as INfeGateway
    participant NFSe as INfseGateway
    participant Blob as IBlobStorage

    UI->>API: POST /fiscal-documents/from-order
    API->>Sales: pedido pago e itens
    API->>Inv: NCM CEST origem
    API->>Core: CPF nome endereco
    API->>Dom: Draft NFe e ou NFSe
    alt linhas produto
        API->>NFe: Authorize
        NFe-->>API: chave XML protocolo
    end
    alt linhas servico
        API->>NFSe: Authorize DPS
        NFSe-->>API: chave NFS-e XML
    end
    API->>Blob: XML e DANFE
    API-->>UI: ids documentos
